{"id":103427,"imdb":"tt2265641","en":"Omar & Salma 3","orig":"عمر وسلمى 3","ar":"عمر وسلمى 3","tag":null,"ov":"فى هذا الجزء يستمر عمر فى تصرفاته الطائشة وعدم العمل فى وظيفة، ويقرر العمل كمطرب شعبى وترفض سلمى ذلك وترفض ايضا ملاحقته للبنات. فتقرر خلعه وتنجح فى ذلك بمساعدة بناتهما؛ فيقرر عمر عقابها بادعائه خطوبة فتاة على درجة عالية من الجمال، واختطاف البنتين لتأديب سلمى. فتكون المفاجأة ان والد عمر قد لقن الاثنين درسا حتى لا يتلاعبان بالطلاق والخلع مرة اخرى.","rd":"2012-01-10","rt":96,"g":[35,10749],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":3330952,"companies":[],"countries":["EG"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":"Omar & Salma Collection","rel":[{"c":"EG","d":"2012-01-10"}],"dir":["Mohamed Samy"],"prod":["Mohamed El Sobky"],"wri":["Tamer Hosny","Ahmed Abdel Fattah"],"mus":["Nabil Ali Maher"],"dop":["Mohsen Ahmed"],"cast":[{"n":"Tamer Hosny","ch":"عمر","p":"/2YGi3xoFD3EKXUKprTkRXVRHquH.jpg"},{"n":"Mai Ezz ElDein","ch":"سلمى","p":"/wY9iQnLrJTwlTu8Nz4lAk3H5d8l.jpg"},{"n":"Ezzat Abu Ouf","ch":"رشدي","p":"/b4YIsca9urhYbAUWf1ftW440gcd.jpg"},{"n":"Lamitta Frangieh","ch":"سوسكا","p":"/8EzHYBN6LOh1lK21KwtyBmFvut9.jpg"},{"n":"Abd Allah Meshref","ch":"","p":"/agbxF5mqQws2izKEnJz2zvaz4Rw.jpg"},{"n":"Nahla Zaki","ch":"نهلة","p":null},{"n":"Layla Ahmed Zaher","ch":"ليلى - إبنة عمر وسلمى","p":"/hkHnRrcu0mtpgysBaXyzGYxalQv.jpg"},{"n":"Malak Ahmed Zaher","ch":"ملك - إبنة عمر وسلمى","p":"/2wpsDLcUpwPxyLK7ggQk6TclyFp.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed El Tohami","ch":"","p":"/jOz7cX1kM82ej0UmhJICF2283ab.jpg"},{"n":"Hossam El Husseini","ch":"","p":"/6Lxj8XnS360WrAmDtz1TVtHXnof.jpg"},{"n":"Mamdouh Farag","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Elham Abdel Badea","ch":"","p":"/g0i5ZO9s1R8XSMVqKJoWxzXU4Ts.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed El Sobky","ch":"","p":"/9KG5fi6jXlb0J5CmOY1lIISqEzu.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Qishta","ch":"","p":"/65mGHO2yo9A9xN5UNRUEhyTggR2.jpg"},{"n":"Ehsan ElTurk","ch":"","p":"/4igZqjN1eCv6lpwTwPaagXtT079.jpg"},{"n":"Sameh Abu ElGhar","ch":"","p":"/khwleAJoImVQblqzqauatQYi95f.jpg"}]}